Scope of this repository
------------------------

This repository contains the generic, minimal privileged bridge and its
versioned wire-protocol crate. The bridge performs only explicitly typed,
paired operations that require privileges unavailable to a sandboxed app; it
does not own automation, module configuration, scheduling, or the user
interface. Homebrew remains responsible for its own package maintenance.

The paid Scriptd desktop application is maintained separately. It owns rules,
schedules, policies, presets, configuration, and all product interface code.
Those private product sources are not part of this repository or its release
archives.
